[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Move apps to their new place
Name[nl]=Apps naar hun nieuwe plek verhuizen
Comment=Moves your Firefox and Steam to the Firefox and Steam apps, so nothing is lost
Comment[nl]=Verhuist je Firefox en Steam naar de losse apps, zodat je niets kwijt bent
Exec=/usr/bin/bugos-verhuis-apps
NoDisplay=true
OnlyShowIn=KDE;
X-KDE-autostart-phase=1
